{"pageid":3315,"title":"Heavenly Pollaxe","displaytitle":"<span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Heavenly Pollaxe</span>","revid":19964,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><i><big>\"An axe forged by the gods of the moon! This gravity including axe lower the weight of objects, and makes them float.\"</big></i>\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default type-wood\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title1\">Heavenly Pollaxe</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image1\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/b/be/Heavenly_pollaxe.png/revision/latest?cb=20241011182617\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Heavenly pollaxe\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/b/be/Heavenly_pollaxe.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20241011182617\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/b/be/Heavenly_pollaxe.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20241011182617 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/b/be/Heavenly_pollaxe.png/revision/latest?cb=20241011182617 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Heavenly pollaxe\" width=\"270\" height=\"463\" data-image-key=\"Heavenly_pollaxe.png\" data-image-name=\"Heavenly pollaxe.png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tStats\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tInfo\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Island\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Finlay</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Shop\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Shop</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">The Manor</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Swing Power\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Swing Power</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">0.8</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Swing Distance\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Swing Distance</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">18.75 studs</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Swing Time\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Swing Time</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">2.1875</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Version Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">v1.68.0</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">October 4th, 2024</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p>The <b>Heavenly Pollaxe</b> is an axe added on the <b>2024 Halloween Event.</b> It is made by combining the <a href=\"/wiki/Hardened_Moon_Rod\" title=\"Hardened Moon Rod\">Hardened Moon Rod</a> with a <a href=\"/wiki/Moon_Shard\" title=\"Moon Shard\">Waxing Gibbous Moon Shard</a> at the top of the <b>Manor</b>.  \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appearance\">Appearance</span></h2>\n<p>The <b>Heavenly Pollaxe</b> is a large sized axe, with a texture close to marble. It has a spiked headpiece and a shape resembling a halberd, and a small hexagonal hole just below the headpiece. The axe head is white in color while the handle is a light grey.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<ul><li>The swing speed is the same as the <a href=\"/wiki/Reinforced_Axe\" title=\"Reinforced Axe\">Reinforced Axe</a>.</li></ul>\n<ul><li>Previously, the anti-gravity effect applied by the axe makes things have negative gravity while holding the <a href=\"/wiki/Gravity_Coil\" title=\"Gravity Coil\">Gravity coil</a> or the <a href=\"/wiki/Fusion_Coil\" title=\"Fusion Coil\">fusion coil</a>. As of 7-10-2024, this glitch has been patched.</li></ul>\n<ul><li>There is a rare chance when using the <b>Bandsaw</b> to cut wood that had been cut with the <b>Heavenly Pollaxe</b>, the wood will have permanently reversed gravity.</li></ul>\n<ul><li>The axe itself emanates a small amount of light, and has a <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://create.roblox.com/docs/reference/engine/classes/Highlight\">highlight</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260902070152\nCache expiry: 1209600\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.027 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.034 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 68/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 68/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 7/2097152 byt